{
  "_comment": [
    "The bot players (PLAN.md \u00a718.8). Each one is a person the platform treats like any other: a name, a",
    "body (used for calories), a weekly habit, and a pair of legs. They play the real games, so what the",
    "platform records about them is real.",
    "",
    "fitness.watts        what they hold on a steady ride today",
    "fitness.variability  how far their effort wanders around it (a slow walk, not per-second noise)",
    "fitness.fatiguePerMinute  the fraction of their power they lose each minute of a session",
    "fitness.skillPerMonth     how much they improve a month; a backdated ride is weaker by this much per month",
    "schedule             how many days a week, when they usually start, and how long they go for",
    "",
    "Edit this file, then `npm run upsert` in bots/. Profiles can also be edited in the console's Admin page;",
    "avatarSeed          their looks: `npm run avatars` turns it into a full AvatarSpec with avatarkit's",
    "                    own random generator, so this file stays readable. Change the number for a new face.",
    "the performance curves live only here."
  ],
